+/* Diagnostic-vocabulary lint: scans the ENTIRE selftest source (and its own)
+   line by line, so no invented term can return in any diagnostic message —
+   including branches a session never renders. Machine identifiers are allowed
+   only in their known code shapes; lines that must mention the banned
